OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly rain in the east quickly
OL,6,Fclearing, leaving a morning of
OL,7,Fsunshine and a scattering of showers,
OL,8,Fmainly in the west. The showers
OL,9,Fbecoming more widespread throughout
OL,10,Fthe afternoon, potentially turning
OL,11,Fheavy in places. Feeling warm in the
OL,12,Fsunshine.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FScattered showers continuing
OL,15,Fthis evening and overnight, with some
OL,16,Fclearer spells developing in between.
OL,17,FFeeling a little cooler than last
OL,18,Fnight, especially in the clearer
OL,19,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
