OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA morning of sunny spells
OL,6,Fand a scattering of showers, although
OL,7,Fshowers tending to ease towards
OL,8,Flunchtime. Many areas becoming dry
OL,9,Fthroughout the afternoon, with
OL,10,Ftemperatures nearer average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,13,Freturns on Friday, potentially heavy
OL,14,Ffor a time. A risk of some further
OL,15,Frain on Saturday before turning drier
OL,16,Fand brighter on Sunday. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average for early October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
